      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "Listen",
        "heading": "Podcasts and shows",
        "body": "<p>Hosted by a knowledgeable team of sports enthusiasts, the Nation podcasts cover game previews and recaps, in-depth analysis, player interviews and insider discussion. Whether you want the latest news, expert opinion or an entertaining argument about the team you love, the shows have it.</p>",
